  "response": {
    "text": "**Objective**\nWipe memory on idle buoy `T-10`. (Does not affect active buoy `T-12`.)\n\n**Prerequisites**\n* Permit `WIPE-44` is valid.\n* Buoy `T-10` is disconnected.\n* Console displays **Safe to Purge**.\n\n**Procedure**\n\n1. Run the status check command:\n   ```\n   thalassactl buoy check T-10\n   ```\n   *Note: Proceed only if the command returns `status=idle mem=full`.*\n\n2. Purge the buoy memory:\n   > **WARNING:** The following command permanently deletes all data on `T-10`. A remote restore is impossible.\n\n   ```\n   thalassactl buoy purge T-10 --permit WIPE-44\n   ```\n\n3. Verify the memory wipe:\n   ```\n   thalassactl buoy verify T-10\n   ```\n   Confirm that the command returns `mem=empty`.",
